WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.200
jocko what motivates you
i heard you mentioned the man in the

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:11.440
cave can you go deeper on this
what motivates me

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:21.439
well i've talked about this before and
it's kind of what we were talking about

00:00:21.439 --> 00:00:26.880
a couple minutes ago as well
and that is first of all with the man in

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:31.760
the cave
and this idea and this thought of

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:37.920
the enemy and and
that was a thought that used to drive me

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:41.920
and
kind of haunt me and make me get up

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:48.800
early and work hard to push myself
because i knew that

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:55.600
somewhere out there
there was an enemy a real enemy a real

00:00:55.600 --> 00:01:00.480
man
a person a human

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:03.840
that was waiting for me and that was
preparing

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:10.400
for me and
therefore i needed

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:16.159
to prepare for him i needed to be ready
i needed to be the things i always talk

00:01:16.159 --> 00:01:21.520
about i needed to be stronger and faster
and smarter and better

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:27.840
so that when we did meet on the
battlefield

00:01:29.119 --> 00:01:37.119
i would be ready for that
rendezvous for that meeting that fate

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:43.040
that battle
and that thought that thought of the

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:48.720
enemy
yes it absolutely fueled me

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:54.000
and when i was a leader in the seal
teams in charge of

00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:01.600
men it was even more profound
because i was thinking about that

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:06.320
rendezvous
for everybody that i led everyone i was

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:10.000
in charge of everyone that i trained

00:02:10.959 --> 00:02:17.440
and i felt that burden the burden of
responsibility

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:25.599
to prepare those men and protect those
those men those those frog men

00:02:25.599 --> 00:02:28.560
those warriors

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:32.239
my brothers

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:45.200
and it it was my burden
to train those guys and prepare them

00:02:47.599 --> 00:02:51.440
and that burden it may have made me a
little bit

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:57.280
crazy a little bit paranoid a little bit
over the top

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:05.840
but i didn't really know
any

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:09.280
any other way

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:19.840
and so now

00:03:20.959 --> 00:03:24.000
i am no longer

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:28.879
a combat leader

00:03:29.840 --> 00:03:34.640
i no longer prepare men for war

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:39.360
so the drive

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:42.879
and the motivation

00:03:43.519 --> 00:03:47.840
is from a different place

00:03:50.159 --> 00:03:54.000
it's from a solemn place

00:03:55.920 --> 00:04:05.680
the drive now and the motivation now is
not really from the enemy anymore

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:19.919
now it's from my friends my brothers
it's from those

00:04:19.919 --> 00:04:29.840
seals that i knew

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:34.800
and that i

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:44.880
cared about more than anything

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:50.479
and that they sacrificed

00:04:54.840 --> 00:05:01.440
everything
for us and for me and those guys

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:11.840
they gave their lives for us

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:23.440
and now i cannot
help but think and remember

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:31.199
that every breath that we take
is a it's a

00:05:31.199 --> 00:05:38.639
gift it's a sacred gift
from those men

00:05:38.639 --> 00:05:44.400
every day we have every sunrise
every thought and every smile and every

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:53.840
laugh
it's a gift

00:05:53.919 --> 00:06:02.880
and i will treasure
that gift that gift of life

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:07.919
and i will not let it go to waste not
one

00:06:07.919 --> 00:06:10.720
second of it

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:20.319
and i'll cherish every moment of it
and i will live it

00:06:20.319 --> 00:06:25.120
i will live it

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:28.639
in their memory

00:06:31.759 --> 00:06:35.840
and in their honor

